      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"We've re-published the packages for 3.5.0-beta.1 as 3.5.0 in order to fix some issues with version comparisons for community packages. They are otherwise the same, but no longer require prerelease packages to be turned on in order to use them.\" - Tupper, in VRC Discord Server.\n\nIt is the same beta just renamed.",
