      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d65fbf6191d25575d63ee9d|full_name}: For my part, this \"Got it, loud and clear\" message is NOT appreciated.\n\nThe whole announcement is yet another instance of a continued series of disrespect towards its creators. We have an update, which was supposed to be just a technical workaround, and now it's been retconned as an actual release. VRChat has not having made any blog post about that release, and no Twitter communication to advertise the release, so no, this isn't a release, it's a cop out that they can afford because no one will stand in their way.\n\nVRChat should have rang the alarm bells and rollback, putting an halt to the open beta immediately. Instead what we have here is a platform that now has learned that it can force the hand of all of its tool creators to instantly assess an update without suffering any consequence from its actions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
