      "value": "@{5f2d204b74493130abcdca6e|full_name}: I don't intend to fully forgive through this message myself. It's more of a sense of \"bewilderment\" than \"anger\" at this point. Putting it into words seems so easy, doesn't it? It's just that we, who are expressing our thoughts here, don't seem to fit the definition of creators according to VRChat.\n\n日本語原文\n\n私自身もこのメッセージで完全に許したというつもりはありません。\n\nただ、「怒り」というよりはもう「呆れてしまった」んです。言葉にするのだけなら簡単だろって。\n\nVRChatの言うクリエイターに今ここに書き込んでいる我々は居ないのだと。",
